<verse eid="JOL 2:28" /><verse style="v" number="29" sid="JOL 2:29" />And also on the menservants and on the maidservants, || In those days I pour out My Spirit.
<verse eid="JOL 2:29" /><verse style="v" number="30" sid="JOL 2:30" />And I have given wonders in the heavens and in the earth: Blood, and fire, and columns of smoke.
<verse eid="JOL 2:30" /><verse style="v" number="31" sid="JOL 2:31" />The sun is turned to darkness, and the moon to blood, || Before the coming of the Day of <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char>, || The great and the fearful. <verse eid="JOL 2:31" /><verse style="v" number="32" sid="JOL 2:32" />And it has come to pass, || Everyone who calls on the Name of <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char> is delivered, || For in Mount Zion and in Jerusalem there is an escape, || As <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char> has said, || And among the remnants whom <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char> is calling!”<verse eid="JOL 2:32" /></para>
